"A","correct_answer":true},{"answer_text":"are obstructions in the road for 1 km.","answer_number":"B","correct_answer":false},{"answer_text":"are road works within 1 km.","answer_number":"C","correct_answer":false}],"source_id":5,"is_duplicate":false,"is_official":false},{"id":1461,"question_number":583,"question_text":"The driver of a vehicle shall not cross a public road unless...","category":1,"license_code":"00","contains_image":false,"image_link":null,"options":[{"answer_text":"he/she looks and signals his/her intentions and then moves onto the roadway.","answer_number":"A","correct_answer":false},{"answer_text":"the road is clear of moving traffic for a sufficient distance to allow him / her to cross the road without obstructing or endangering any traffic.","answer_number":"B","correct_answer":true},{"answer_text":"he/she looks into the rear view mirror, engages gears and accelerates, so that he/she can enter the road.","answer_number":"C","correct_answer":false}],"source_id":5,"is_duplicate":false,"is_official":false},{"id":1462,"question_number":584,"question_text":"What is the purpose of an accelerator?","category":3,"license_code":"00","contains_image":false,"image_link":null,"options":[{"answer_text":"it is used to turn a vehicle in an emergency.","answer_number":"A","correct_answer":false},{"answer_text":"It is used to stop a vehicle.","answer_number":"B","correct_answer":false},{"answer_text":"It is used to increase or decrease the speed of a vehicle.","answer_number":"C","correct_answer":true}],"source_id":5,"is_duplicate":false,"is_official":false},{"id":1463,"question_number":585,"question_text":"The appropriate reaction to this sign is to ...","category":2,"license_code":"00","contains_image":true,"image_link":null,"options":[{"answer_text":"stop, as the road is closed.","answer_number":"A","correct_answer":false},{"answer_text":"turn around as the road ends.","answer_number":"B","correct_answer":false},{"answer_text":"slow down and prepare to stop